+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+//  AI(W906-IOWIDGET-3) 20261001: golden's TestSuck sequence (EastSun 20261001 "TestSuck 走 Suck() 流程").
+//  golden iosetview.cpp:47 `TMySucker *mySuckerTemp;` + the form's bChangeSuckStatus: a TestSuck button pressed
+//  while the Index holds an IC does not write its coil -- it picks the test sucker it is the _On / _Off of and
